# Tech Stack

Use only these packages. Never suggest alternatives.

| Concern | Package |
|---------|---------|
| Framework | Next.js 14 App Router |
| Language | TypeScript strict — `.ts` / `.tsx` only |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS utility classes only |
| Components | shadcn/ui — extend, never replace |
| Server state | `@tanstack/react-query` |
| Client state | `zustand` |
| Forms | `react-hook-form` + `zod` + `@hookform/resolvers/zod` |
| Tables | `@tanstack/react-table` |
| Drag/drop | `@dnd-kit/core` + `@dnd-kit/sortable` |
| Database | `drizzle-orm/pg-core` — import from `@vantera/db` |
| DB client | `import { db } from '@/lib/db/client'` — never instantiate inline |
| Auth | Supabase via `@supabase/ssr` |
| Jobs | `@trigger.dev/sdk` |
| Email | `resend` + `@react-email/components` |
| SMS | `twilio` |
| Payments | `stripe` + `@stripe/stripe-js` |
| AI | `ai` + `@ai-sdk/anthropic` |
| Animation | `framer-motion` |
| Charts | `recharts` |
| Icons | `lucide-react` — no other icon library |
| Dates | `date-fns` — never moment.js or dayjs |
| HTTP | Native `fetch` only — no axios in components |
